<title>USA: Cornerstone sets first qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Cornerstone sets first qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cornerstone Properties Inc announced a quarterly dividend of $0.30 on Monday -- the first since completing its initial public offering in April.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on July 31 to stockholders of record June 20.</p>
<p>Cornerstone is a self-administered equity real estate investment trust (REIT) investing exclusively in office properties in major metropolitan areas and central business districts.</p>
